#: ../../source/reference/progressbar.rst:13
msgid ""
"The ProgressBar class is designed to provide a graphical representation "
"of progress with customizable appearance and range. It supports features "
"such as setting the minimum and maximum values, adjusting the progress "
"value, and specifying visual elements for background and progress "
"indicator."
